  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for xwayland",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for xwayland fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-88812: XKB SetGeometry TextDoodad Double Free (bsc#1281213).\n- CVE-2026-93515: X.Org Server Present Extension Use-After-Free (bsc#1281218).\n- CVE-2026-93516: X.Org Server XInput Passive Grab Use-After-Free (bsc#1281220).\n- CVE-2026-93517: GLX RenderLarge Heap Buffer Overflow (bsc#1281225).\n- CVE-2026-93518: XKB ResizeKeyType Numeric Truncation (bsc#1281227).\n- CVE-2026-93519: XFixes Pointer Barrier Event List Buffer Overflow (bsc#1281233).\n- CVE-2026-93520: XKB ChangeKeycodeRange Heap Out-of-Bounds Write (bsc#1281236).\n- CVE-2026-93521: RandR ChangeProviderProperty Heap Buffer Overflow (bsc#1281238).\n- CVE-2026-93522: Glamor CopyArea Heap Buffer Overflow (bsc#1281240).\n- CVE-2026-93523: XInput2 PassiveUngrabDevice Out-of-Bounds Write (bsc#1281241).\n- CVE-2026-93524: XKB SetMap Key Width/Action Count Desync Out-Of-Bounds Read (bsc#1281242).\n- CVE-2026-93536: GestureBuildSprite Use-After-Free (bsc#1281244).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
